      "text": "Afterwards it's just testing and testing and testing\n\nFor context our project is a visual assistant for the blind\nThe whole reason for this trip is for the Intel Embedded Cup, its a contest where you are given an Intel Board with an NPU, and you make a project with it and present\n\nWe made it able to\n1. Speech to Text\n2. Describe a scene\n3. Pre-emptively identify hazards\n\nWe have a dual LLM Architecture with Qwen 3.5 and Gemma, Qwen 3.5 always does scene description, Gemma answers the questions of the users\n\nLast min we were evaluating models and settled on Gemma 4 VLM for answering questions\n",
